        "label": "Lesson 18 • Discussing Office Scandals",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "description": [
              {
                "text": "With his naughty behavior, Bill Swing provides plenty of material for office gossip. Cindy and Steve discuss his latest move and review his other recent insensitive behavior."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Cindy: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Did you hear "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "the latest dirt"
                },
                {
                  "text": "?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Steve: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Of course not. I'm totally "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "out of the loop"
                },
                {
                  "text": "! I'm always the last one to find out everything."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Cindy: "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "According to the rumor mill"
                },
                {
                  "text": ", Bill swing "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "made a pass at"
                },
                {
                  "text": " Laura Teller, the new marketing manager. Now she's threatening to sue him for sexual harassment."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Steve: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Sounds like Bill's "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "up to his old tricks"
                },
                {
                  "text": " again. He's always "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "on the make"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". Last year, Paula Reynolds accused him of pinching her..."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Cindy: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I remember that. Too bad Paula quit before they could "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "get to the bottom of it"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Steve: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Two years ago he "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "got nailed"
                },
                {
                  "text": " for organizing a company offsite* to a strip joint*!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Cindy: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Oh, that really "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "takes the cake"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". That's so "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "un- PC"
                },
                {
                  "text": "!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Steve: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Bill is definitely not "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "politically correct"
                },
                {
                  "text": "!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Cindy: "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "What goes around comes around"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". One day, "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "he'll get his"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
